  "en": "93B Telok Blangah Street 31"
 },
 "description": "Introducing an exceptional opportunity for first-time home buyers and young professionals seeking a luxurious lifestyle in the heart of Singapore’s prime District 4. Nestled at 93B Telok Blangah Street 31, this stunning HDB Apartment offers a modern living experience with its construction completed in 2018. The property is currently available for sale at a competitive price of $950,000, making it an attractive investment in one of the city's most sought-after locations.\n\nThis beautifully designed apartment boasts three spacious bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms, providing ample space for comfort and relaxation. The unit's contemporary layout and design are perfect for those who appreciate a blend of style and functionality. As a Leasehold 99 (L99) property, it offers a balance of value and long-term security, ideal for young families and professionals planning for the future.\n\nSituated on Telok Blangah Street 31, this property is in a vibrant neighborhood with excellent connectivity and a host of amenities nearby. Whether you're commuting to work or exploring the city's vibrant culture, this location offers convenience and accessibility. Don't miss out on the chance to own a piece of luxury in a prime area. Contact us today to arrange a viewing and experience firsthand what makes 93B Telok Blangah Street 31 a perfect choice for a sophisticated urban lifestyle.\nJasper: 91830433",
